        "headline": "Red Flag Warning issued June 4 at 3:55AM AKDT until June 4 at 9:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "The National Weather Service in Anchorage has issued a Red Flag\nWarning FOR HOT DRY AND WINDY CONDITIONS, which is in effect from\n1 PM this afternoon to 9 PM AKDT this evening.\n\n* Winds...Northwest 10 to 15 mph with gusts up to 20 mph at times.\n\n* Timing...1 PM AKDT through 9 PM AKDT this evening.\n\n* Relative Humidity...As low as 20 to 25 percent.\n\n* Temperatures...As high as 75 to 77 degrees.\n\n* Location...Lake Iliamna.\n\n* Impacts...Rapid ignition, growth and spread of fires will be\npossible.\n\n",
